
Install Instructions for VIT
----------------------------

## the fleet way (planned, vit 1.4.0)...
tw -I vit

## by hand...
./build.sh                               # builds build/vit
cp build/vit ~/bin/                      # or anywhere on PATH

Requires perl with Curses, Try::Tiny, Text::CharWidth
(Debian/Ubuntu: libcurses-perl libtry-tiny-perl libtext-charwidth-perl).

## for GTK+ (Gnome) colors...
add the configuration strings in taskrc-gtk+ to your ~/.taskrc file
